{"id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-grothendieck-topology.md","title":"Definition — Grothendieck Topology","display":"Definition — Grothendieck Topology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-grothendieck-topology","aliases":["14-df-grothendieck-topology"],"display":"Definition — Grothendieck Topology","depends_on":["[[14-df-small-category]]","[[14-df-sieve]]","[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]","[[14-df-category]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-grothendieck-topology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-grothendieck-topology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Grothendieck Topology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"898681611f432286\" href=\"?note=898681611f432286\" title=\"14-df-small-category\">14-df-small-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55b5b594c94a4b33\" href=\"?note=55b5b594c94a4b33\" title=\"14-df-sieve-pullback\">14-df-sieve-pullback</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> (category, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ob},\\mathrm{dom}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ob},\\mathrm{dom}\\)</span> (object set and source map, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSieve},\\mathrm{MaxSieve}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSieve},\\mathrm{MaxSieve}\\)</span> (sieve predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PullSieve}\">\\(\\mathrm{PullSieve}\\)</span> (pullback-sieve operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"55b5b594c94a4b33\" href=\"?note=55b5b594c94a4b33\" title=\"14-df-sieve-pullback\">14-df-sieve-pullback</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (covering-sieve assignment)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)))\">\\(J:\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)))\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\Bigl(\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;J(C)\\subseteq\\{S\\mid\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)\\}\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\in J(C)\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall S\\in J(C)\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\;\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(f,S)\\in J(D)\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall S\\in J(C)\\;\\forall R\\;(\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(R,C)\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;(\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(f,R)\\in J(\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f)))\\to R\\in J(C))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\Bigl(\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;J(C)\\subseteq\\{S\\mid\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)\\}\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\in J(C)\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall S\\in J(C)\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\;\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(f,S)\\in J(D)\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall S\\in J(C)\\;\\forall R\\;(\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(R,C)\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;(\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(f,R)\\in J(\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f)))\\to R\\in J(C))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.2 Grothendieck Topologies。</p>\n<p>三条公理分别是极大筛覆盖、覆盖对逆像稳定、覆盖的局部性。上闭性与有限交封闭性可推出，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d09d6567cd8efb10\" href=\"?note=d09d6567cd8efb10\" title=\"14-thm-covering-sieve-closure\">14-thm-covering-sieve-closure</a>；不能另把“筛包含恒等箭头”加入覆盖定义，否则退化成极大筛。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-small-category","status":"resolved","id":"898681611f432286","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"55b5b594c94a4b33","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)$ (category, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ob},\\mathrm{dom}$ (object set and source map, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSieve},\\mathrm{MaxSieve}$ (sieve predicates, see [[14-df-sieve]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"55b5b594c94a4b33","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PullSieve}$ (pullback-sieve operation, see [[14-df-sieve-pullback]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-covering-sieve-closure","status":"resolved","id":"d09d6567cd8efb10","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"三条公理分别是极大筛覆盖、覆盖对逆像稳定、覆盖的局部性。上闭性与有限交封闭性可推出，见 [[14-thm-covering-sieve-closure]]；不能另把“筛包含恒等箭头”加入覆盖定义，否则退化成极大筛。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ob},\\mathrm{dom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSieve},\\mathrm{MaxSieve}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PullSieve}","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"J:\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\Bigl(\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;J(C)\\subseteq\\{S\\mid\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)\\}\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\in J(C)\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall S\\in J(C)\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\;\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(f,S)\\in J(D)\\Bigr)\\land\\Bigl(\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall S\\in J(C)\\;\\forall R\\;(\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(R,C)\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;(\\mathrm{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(f,R)\\in J(\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f)))\\to R\\in J(C))\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":2002,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-topology|Definition — Grothendieck Topology]]"},{"id":"f51bc0e57c805ccf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"37f646888720f3eb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]"},{"id":"bcaaa430e12534f8","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C_X}$、$\\mathrm{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C_X}$ 采用 [[14-df-sieve]]；$\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopology}$ 采用 [[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]。"},{"id"